# One Caddy file per service: <service>.conf holds the site blocks of every
# network layer the service is enabled on (tailnet, Cloudflare, I2P, Tor,
# Yggdrasil). Rendered by `homelab enable|disable` from
# services/<service>/exposure.yaml plus its config.yaml ports (or its
# caddy.routes.conf); removed when the service is on no layer.
# Do not edit by hand — `homelab reload <service>` re-renders it.
